  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-19T15:50:16.829Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I changed the password of my VRChat account and was able to log in without having to enter my new credentials.\nI expected the login token to be invalidated when I change my password and every active session to end, returning the player to the login interface.\nThis is important to stop a malicious actor of using an account they gained access to.\nI would propose the ability to invalidate logins when the 2FA is added/modified or the password has been altered. This would also include deleting locations the user granted login access to.",
